# Compose UI Rules

- Screens are thin; state from ViewModel via `UiState` + `collectAsStateWithLifecycle`
- Composables are stateless; pass callbacks for events
- Theme tokens: `ui/theme/Color.kt` (app chrome + felt greens for game screen)
- Cards: always `CardFace` — routes via `LocalCardTheme` to `IllustratedCardFace` (WebP) or `MinimalCardFace`
- Game layout: `GameTableLayout` — opponents around table, deck top-center, hand fan, action button
- Opponent name plate: compact 2×8 chars (`formatCompactOpponentName`); tap expands avatar + full name (10s auto-collapse)
- Settings (`ProfileScreen`): theme mode, card theme, sounds only — **no** avatar / display name
- Online: requires login; displayName в `OnlineLobbyScreen` = account username (**read-only**); avatar выбирается в лобби
- Navigation: `AppNavGraph` + `Routes`; all user-facing strings in Russian
- `@Preview` for standalone components

```kotlin
// ✅
@Composable
fun OfflineSetupScreen(onStartClick: () -> Unit, modifier: Modifier = Modifier)

// ❌
@Composable
fun OfflineSetupScreen() { viewModel.onStartClick() }
```
